    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Write for the reader",
      "items": [
        "Apply asd-ste100-technical and unslop during writing, not as another delivery pipeline.",
        "Separate tutorials, task guides, reference, and explanation. Add a diagram only when it helps."
      ]
